#: src/ui/settings.rs:618
msgid ""
"Tell TIDAL what you listen to, as its own apps do, for your history and "
"recommendations."
msgstr "像 TIDAL 官方應用程式一樣告訴 TIDAL 你聽了什麼，用於播放記錄和推薦。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:623
msgid "Keep playing similar content when your queue ends."
msgstr "佇列播放結束後，繼續播放類似內容。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:627
msgid "Play tracks without silence between them."
msgstr "歌曲之間不插入靜音。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:630
msgid "Output buffer"
msgstr "輸出緩衝區"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:633
msgid ""
"More buffering can prevent clicks on busy computers. Less buffering makes "
"controls respond sooner."
msgstr "加大緩衝區可避免忙碌的電腦出現爆音，縮小緩衝區則能讓控制項更快回應。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:638
msgid "Playback settings applied"
msgstr "已套用播放設定"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:643
msgid ""
"When on, music labeled with the E badge will be playable. To prevent "
"explicit music from playing, switch this off. Videos aren't included. "
"(Tracks will appear greyed out.)"
msgstr ""
"開啟後，帶有 E 標章的音樂可以播放。若要阻止播放含露骨內容的音樂，請關閉此選"
"項。不包含影片。（曲目將顯示為灰色。）"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:650
msgid ""
"When on, music labeled with the AI badge will be playable. To prevent AI-"
"labeled music from playing, switch this off. (Tracks will appear greyed out.)"
msgstr ""
"開啟後，帶有 AI 標章的音樂可以播放。若要阻止播放 AI 標記的音樂，請關閉此選"
"項。（曲目將顯示為灰色。）"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:667
