msgstr "網路要求的 Proxy：關閉、系統、HTTP 或 SOCKS5。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1273
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1274
msgid "Middle-click autoscroll"
msgstr "中鍵自動捲動"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1280
msgid ""
"Middle-click a list, then move the pointer to scroll it. Off by default, "
"because a middle click usually pastes on Linux."
msgstr ""
"在清單上按一下滑鼠中鍵，然後移動指標即可捲動。預設為關閉，因為在 Linux 上按中"
"鍵通常會貼上。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1285
msgid "TIDAL client"
msgstr "TIDAL 用戶端"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1288
msgid ""
"Optional: a TIDAL client to sign in with instead of the built-in one. Leave "
"empty to use the built-in one; changes apply at the next sign-in."
msgstr ""
"選填：使用 TIDAL 用戶端登入，而不是內建用戶端。留空則使用內建用戶端；變更會在"
"下次登入時生效。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1339
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "用戶端 ID"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1344
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "用戶端密鑰"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1349
msgid "Browser sign-in client ID (Max)"
msgstr "瀏覽器登入用戶端 ID（Max）"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1387
msgctxt "proxy"
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1390
msgid ""
"Off ignores environment variables. System uses them, and the OS proxy on "
"macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"「關閉」會忽略環境變數。「系統」會使用環境變數，在 macOS 和 Windows 上還會使"
"用作業系統的 Proxy。"

